course: dictionary
lesson: 6504
title: The word need
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Need is a small word with a big job. It can mean you have to have something, because you cannot do well without it. «The hyacinth macaw's beak cracks palm nuts so hard that people need a hammer.» Without a hammer, people cannot manage those nuts.
explain: Need can also mean you have to do something. «Older children in big families still need breakfast, sleep and time for themselves.» Here need is about what a child must have to stay well and happy.
explain: Look at the words around need for clues. «You needn't come» means you do not have to come, so coming is optional. «Neptune needs about 165 of our years» means one trip around the Sun takes Neptune about that long.
explain: A check you can always use: swap in a meaning and read the sentence again. If it still makes sense, you have found the right meaning.
fact: Need means you must have something, or must do something, to get by.
fact: A need is something a living thing must have, like air, water, food or a home.
fact: «Needn't» means do not have to, as in «You needn't come.»
fact: Casually, need is often used for want: «I need a drink» means «I want a drink.»
fact: «Need a hand?» means «Can I help?» and «in need» means lacking what you must have.
exercise: In «people need a hammer», what does need mean? | Would enjoy | Found in a shop | *Have to have, because nothing else would work well enough | Are sure to lose
exercise: «You needn't come.» What does needn't mean? | Cannot come | Will come later | Must come quickly | *Do not have to
exercise: Which of these is a need of a living thing? | A new bike | A cinema ticket | A shiny badge | *Water
test: In «Neptune needs about 165 of our years», what does needs mean? | Forgets | *Takes, because one trip around the Sun must have that long | Visits often | Wants to visit
test: Which phrase means «Can I help?» | *Need a hand? | Needs more time | Nobody needs you | No need to hurry
exam: Which sentence uses need to mean something a living thing must have? | I need a new pencil case, I just want one | *Macaws need forests to live in | The shop needs more bread | Nobody needs the bus
